	"Description": "我承认，两个版本似乎没有什么不同...\n<br />将文件下载解压到 /Mods\n<br />\n<br />[b]注意：[/b]无论哪个版本只能通过\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/93]CJB Item Spawner[/url]\u00A0生成的 Red Queen &amp; Blue Rose 召唤崽崽（分类-戒指/Rings）\n<br />（帽子店可以买到戒指，但似乎只能作为摆设）\n<br />可以通过 \uFEFF[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/42597]The Living Valley at Stardew Valley Nexus - Mods and community[/url]\u00A0右键崽崽与他们对话\n<br />——————————————————————————\n<br />Well... Two versions don’t seem to have much difference...\n<br />Download the file and extract it to the [i]/Mods\n<br />[/i]\n<br />[b]Note:[/b]\n<br />Regardless of the version, the companions can only be summoned\u00A0using [b]Red Queen [/b]&amp;[b] Blue Rose[/b]\u00A0generated via\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/93]CJB Item Spawner[/url]\u00A0(Category: Rings).\n<br />After obtaining them, you can summon the kids companions.\n<br />(The rings can be purchased at the Mouse hat shop, but they don’t seem to have any effect.)\n<br />You can also chat with them by right-clicking the companions with\u00A0\uFEFF[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/42597]The Living Valley at Stardew Valley Nexus - Mods and community[/url].",
